Cell["\<\
Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s try to obtain the circular azimuthal angular velocity \
in KS directly. The Kerr-Schild version of Kerr metric is:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96021313036047*^9, 
